flowchart TD
    Mic[Microphone audio] --> Levels[overlay::emit_levels: 16 level buckets, up to 30 per second]
    Levels -->|mic-level event, only while the overlay is enabled| Overlay[Recording overlay]
    Levels -->|same event, loudest bucket| Dock[Floating dock companion]
    Levels -->|same event, only while Appearance is open| Preview[Appearance live preview]
    Overlay --> Choice{Overlay style}
    Choice --> Bars[Bars - default]
    Choice --> Squiggle[Squiggle: SVG line redrawn each animation frame]
    Choice --> Avatar[Avatar: mouth opens with volume, fast open, slow close]
    Dock --> Avatar
    Preview --> Avatar
    Settings[Appearance: overlay style + avatar builder] --> Store[Local studio.json: overlay_visual, avatar]
    Store -->|studio-changed| Overlay
    Store -->|studio-changed| Dock
    Guard[Pause animations / Reduce Motion / hidden window] -->|motion off| Still[Static pose: closed mouth, fixed curve]
    Still -.-> Squiggle
    Still -.-> Avatar
